an8.29:19.1 starts: You should dwell without leakages,
an8.29:19.2 starts: guarded, ever-mindful in the restraints
an8.29:19.3 starts: taught by the One with Vision,
an8.29:19.4 starts: the Kinsman of the Sun.
an8.37:2.3 starts: he gives gifts often to fertile fields
an8.37:2.4 starts: to those who lead the spiritual life.
an8.49:15.3 starts: virtuous, firm in Dhamma,
an8.49:15.4 starts: a speaker of truth.
an8.5:2.3 starts: these conditions that people meet
an8.5:2.4 starts: are impermanent, transient, and subject to change.
